# Sparring Dummy: "You may put a land card milled this way into your hand. You gain 2 life if a Lesson card is milled this way." In
# turn 3 Bot1 declines the milled Island, which stays in the graveyard (no life: it is no Lesson card). In turn 5 the card milled is an
# Earthbending Lesson: nothing is asked (it is no land), Bot1 gains 2 life and the Lesson is in the graveyard. The Lesson that is in the
# graveyard already gains nothing on its own: in turn 7 an Ornithopter is milled and Bot1's life stays at 22.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Sparring Dummy
Ornithopter x4
Memnite
Island
Memnite
Earthbending Lesson
Memnite
Ornithopter
Forest x7

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sparring Dummy.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sparring Dummy.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
? Bot1.Graveyard = Island
? Bot1.Life = 20
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sparring Dummy.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Life = 22
? Bot1.Graveyard = Earthbending Lesson; Island
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Sparring Dummy.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter; Earthbending Lesson; Island
